<title>USA: Syquest to keep Nasdaq listing.</title>
<headline>Syquest to keep Nasdaq listing.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology Inc said Monday it exceeded the financial requirements to list on NASDAQ and will continue to list on the exchange.</p>
<p>It said it obtained approval from the National Association of Securities Dealers after providing detailed information relating to its net tangible assets, capital and surplus.</p>
